<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy Apr 16-30 unleaded reformate.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy Apr 16-30 unleaded reformate.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy 250,000 barrels of unleaded 95-octane reformate for April 16-30 delivery, a company offcial said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks offers by March 18 and valid for two days, on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Keelung, Taichung, Kaohsiung or Shalung.</p>
<p>Taiwan just last week purchased its April 1-15 requirements, 250,000-barrels each of leaded and unleaded reformate at close to $29.00 per barrel, c-and-f.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
